swer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "c444cb95-0304-58c2-9c8e-b011a6cb6412" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "c444cb95-0304-58c2-9c8e-b011a6cb6412" :answer-field/choices "8e92af9b-5c92-5bee-8fa9-0870b452b896"] [:db/add "c444cb95-0304-58c2-9c8e-b011a6cb6412" :answer-field/choices "0688e6a0-d82b-5af3-bcbe-e1d1ac6551c9"] [:db/add "c444cb95-0304-58c2-9c8e-b011a6cb6412" :answer-field/choices "3990cfb0-cbff-5f72-bd38-c7fa260c7970"] [:db/add "c444cb95-0304-58c2-9c8e-b011a6cb6412" :answer-field/choices "b11e48ad-9933-5ab4-8de7-4ff5a9d11f86"] [:db/add "c444cb95-0304-58c2-9c8e-b011a6cb6412" :answer-field/choices "95e3a4c5-3d93-5a0d-b94a-c4d9b0ec3031"] [:db/add "c444cb95-0304-58c2-9c8e-b011a6cb6412" :answer-field/correct "8e92af9b-5c92-5bee-8fa9-0870b452b896"] [:db/ensure "c444cb95-0304-58c2-9c8e-b011a6cb6412" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "166ea0f3-064e-5e9b-9546-4a95c84c5be3" :question/id #uuid "166ea0f3-064e-5e9b-9546-4a95c84c5be3"] [:db/add "166ea0f3-064e-5e9b-9546-4a95c84c5be3" :question/problem "Solve the following system of equations:\n    \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-y-z &=-1 \\\\ y+z &=-2 \\\\ z &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"] [:db/add "166ea0f3-064e-5e9b-9546-4a95c84c5be3" :question/worked-solution "The third equation states that $z=-2.$ Substituting this into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\ny+(-2)=-2.\n$$\n\n$$\ny=-2-(-2)=0.\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute $y=0$ and $z=-2$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\nx-(0)-(-2)=-1.\n$$\n\n$$\nx=-1-(0)-(2)=-3.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=-3$, $y=0$, and $z=-2.$ In vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"] [:db/add "166ea0f3-064e-5e9b-9546-4a95c84c5be3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "166ea0f3-064e-5e9b-9546-4a95c84c5be3" :question/answer-fields "c444cb95-0304-58c2-9c8e-b011a6cb6412"] [:db/ensure "166ea0f3-064e-5e9b-9546-4a95c84c5be3" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096669 :knowledge-point/quest